Firstly, I think that whenever your god grants you an artifact or something, it
is considered a prayer. After being rewarded an artifact, you have to keep
offering or wait until your prayer time out expires. If you keep sacrificing,
"You have a hopeful feeling" means you shouldn't pray, and "You have a feeling
of reconciliation" means you can. 
If your God does become angry (and this happens to me a lot) you have to 
sacrifice something of high level in order to appease him. A newt or a hill
orc just won't do it, and quantity makes no difference, sacrificing 7 hill
orcs consecutively won't work. I remember a vampire bat seemed to do the
trick once.
